What in the plan already matches your requirement ✅

These parts are purely visual refactors (safe):

Phase 0 (design tokens + global CSS utilities + fonts)
No logic changes. Just Tailwind config + globals.css.

Restyling buttons/inputs/cards/tables by swapping classNames
Same components, same hooks, same API calls.

Replacing Header/Sidebar look with Zip2 styling
