Where the original plan could change logic/behavior ⚠️
1) “Create new routes like /management/…”

That changes routing behavior (URLs), redirects, E2E expectations, bookmarks, etc.

2) “Recreate viewer pages as /docs instead of /browse”

Same issue: changing paths = behavior change.

3) “Add new components that restructure content rendering / TOC generation”

If we introduce new parsing or rendering logic (TOC, markdown conversions), it’s no longer “design-only”.

